      "content": "i don't think i can ever look at myself in the mirror again. what i did at work... it wasn't just a mistake, it actually ruined lives. i can see the weight of it every time i close my eyes. i’m just a bad person. there's no coming back from this. i feel like such a stain on everything i touch.",
