    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But it's not just about the pain. It's like... i've fundamentally broken the social contract. how can anyone look at me and not see the damage i caused? i feel like i don't even have the right to just \"move forward\" or exist like nothing happened. it feels more like i'm a parasite at this point.",
