    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but it feels so hollow. like i'm just forcing myself to stay here out of habit, when all i really do is carry this guilt around. sometimes it feels less like \"healing\" and more like just... dragging the wreckage around with me. wouldn't it be more merciful to just stop? to just let the world be better off without my shadow over it?",
